---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/Legal-Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Paul Pietzko"
  description="How paulpietzko.com handles your data."
>
  <LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy">
      <p class="lead">
        I take your privacy seriously. This policy outlines my practices
        regarding data collection and use.
      </p>
      <div>
        <h2>Data Collection</h2>
        <p>
          This site collects anonymous data to better understand how all of you
          interact with this. This helps me improve the overall user experience.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          I use cookies to enhance user experience. These cookies are essential
          for the proper functioning of my website and do not store any personal
          information.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          My site may contain links to third-party websites. I'm not responsible
          for the privacy practices or content of these sites.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          I may update this privacy policy from time to time. I encourage you to
          review this page periodically for any changes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Contact Me</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about our privacy policy, please contact me
          at
          <a
            href="mailto:paul.pietzko@icloud.com"
           
          >
            paul.pietzko@icloud.com
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
</LegalLayout
  >
</Layout>
